<title>USA: Houston Exploration bids $7 mln at sale.</title>
<headline>Houston Exploration bids $7 mln at sale.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Houston Exploration Co said Thursday it submitted bids on 15 tracts in the federal lease sale for the western Gulf of Mexico and was the successful high bidder on 14 tracts at a cost of $6,965,074.75 net.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
